A photorealistic image of a sleek, full-sized folding mountain bike with matte black frame and orange accents, dramatically positioned on a rugged mountain trail at golden hour. The bike is partially folded, showcasing its innovative hinge mechanism, with dust particles catching the warm sunset light. Rocky terrain and alpine wilderness stretch into the background, with dramatic shadows cast across the path. The composition emphasizes the bike's engineering elegance against raw nature, shot from a low angle to make the bike appear heroic and desirable. Sharp focus on the folding joint mechanism, shallow depth of field blurring distant peaks.
